  "reconciles": "v2(stride) = 2 + v2(L), so v2(stride) >= 4 is exactly L divisible by 4, which is exactly the measured immunity. L=1,3 gave +13.8/+14.4%; L=2,6 gave +12.9/+19.7%; L=4,8,12,16 gave -2.9/-7.9/-5.6/-5.4%.",
